     3	## Headline assessment
     4	Not ready to lock. The central recommendation reverses the Pivot source direction: the Pivot PM BRD says NetSuite Orion will replace Workfront, while this section defaults to retaining Workfront. That can be a new leadership decision, but it cannot be presented as source-backed without explicitly flagging it as a reopened architecture decision.
