_Unification/02 - Business Intelligence.md:109:**Recommendation for the merged company.** Build all the 360-style dashboards both companies articulated. They cover different process areas (Backlog, Bookings, Cash Flow, AR Collections, AP, Project Performance) and complement each other rather than compete. Dual GP tracking is adopted as a merged-company capability per Pivot's framework, building on the GP discipline framework already established in CRM §3.02 D-6. The full set of 360 dashboards is designed during the Realize phase based on the merged-company process-area scope.
