_Unification/03 - Marketing.md:210:| **Division taxonomy** | Market-segment targeting (NBD / Venture / Public / Construction Solutions) | **CRM (§3.02 D-3b)** — division taxonomy pending working-session confirmation; Marketing segmentation aligns to whatever lands |
